        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCGEO, Arc Rose with Georgetown Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Georgetown Lever with Arc Rose has a stunning look that is ideal for historic homes and also newer homes with a classic design scheme. The Arc Short Plate with Georgetown Leverset is available in a wide array of traditional finish colors. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. Grandeur's Arc Rose with Georgetown Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCGEO Arc Short Plate with Georgetown Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgetown Lever with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCGEO-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262388\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCGEO Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgetown Lever with Arc Rose",
                "description": "The Georgetown Lever with Arc Rose has a stunning look that is ideal for historic homes and also newer homes with a classic design scheme. The Arc Short Plate with Georgetown Leverset is available in a wide array of traditional finish colors. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. Grandeur's Arc Rose with Georgetown Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
